if-empty-branch.ce:4:39: This if gives nothing before its else: its condition may have taken the value, as -1 in if x < 0 -1 else 0 end, read as x < 0 - 1.
  4 | sign(x) = if x > 0 1 else if x < 0 -1 else 0 end
    |                                       ^
  Put the value on a line of its own, or write it (-1); for an if that only acts when its condition is false, write if not.
exit 1
